{"id":"a88cbf5f6d98949d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-additivity.md","title":"Additivity of an Ideal","display":"df-additivity — Additivity of an Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-additivity","aliases":["58-df-additivity"],"display":"df-additivity — Additivity of an Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-additivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-additivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-additivity — Additivity of an Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (底集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(I,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的集合理想，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (等势谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (本文件定义的加性关系)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup I\">\\(\\bigcup I\\)</span> 为规范底集的兼容记号)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additivity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq I\\;(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\notin I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal G\\subseteq I\\;(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(\\mathcal G,\\lambda)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal G\\notin I)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additivity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq I\\;(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\notin I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal G\\subseteq I\\;(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(\\mathcal G,\\lambda)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal G\\notin I)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Add}(I)=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,\\bigcup I,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Add}(I)=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,\\bigcup I,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\)</span> states that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is the least cardinality of a family in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> whose union leaves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>关系形式不会在不存在见证族时把未定义的“最小值”误当作一个全函数值。</li>\n<li>一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Add}(I)\\)</span> 仅作为以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup I\">\\(\\bigcup I\\)</span> 为底集的偏函数兼容记号，供既有下游原子复用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))$（$X$ 上的集合理想，见 [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (基数谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (等势谓词, see [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additivity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq I\\;(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\notin I)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal G\\subseteq I\\;(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(\\mathcal G,\\lambda)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal G\\notin I)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Add}(I)=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,\\bigcup I,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(I,X,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Add}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup I","display":false}],"bytes":1871,"backlinks":[{"id":"503fb023dfd5f279","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-additivity.md]])"},{"id":"13a5b3e71c6d5d19","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Additivity}_S$ (least witnessed additivity relation, see [[58-df-additivity]])"},{"id":"9327c800e7f50ea0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-additivity]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-additivity.md|58-df-additivity]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","28c79fde9f892bfe"]}